<title>USA: Mississippi to sell $30 million taxable GOs May 13.</title>
<headline>Mississippi to sell $30 million taxable GOs May 13.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mississippi will sell $30 million of taxable general obligation bonds by competitive bid on May 13 at 1200 EDT, the state Bond Commission said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Proceeds will fund a revolving loan program for local government water system improvements. Maturities will be out to 2017.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013))</p>
